== Trivia ==
* [[wikipedia:The High Priestess|The High Priestess]] is the second card of a Major Arcana set.
** The High Priestess, or The Popess, in most of her depictions is a reference to [[wikipedia:Pope Joan|Pope Joan]], a woman that became Pope by disguising herself as a man.

